<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia O'Connor's shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia O'Connor's shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of O'Connor's Corp Bhd were suspended on Thursday at the request of the company pending an announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock of O'Connor's, which sells telecommunications products and distributes electronic and consumer products, closed on Wednesday at 8.70 ringgit.</p>
<p>Company officials could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
